{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2022-11-22 08:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE SETS RECORD BY COLLECTING 19,423 POUNDS OF MEDICATION DURING FOURTH ANNUAL CRUSH THE CRISIS', 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE:HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT COLLECTED 19,423 POUNDS OF UNUSED OR EXPIRED MEDICATIONS DURING ITS FOURTH ANNUAL “CRUSH THE CRISIS” NATIONAL OPIOID TAKE BACK DAY ON OCTOBER 29, 2022. IT IS THE MOST HCA HEALTHCARE HAS COLLECTED IN THIS ANNUAL EVENT, ECLIPSING THE 15,566 POUNDS IT COLLECTED LAST YEAR. HCA HEALTHCARE HAS NOW COLLECTED APPROXIMATELY 54,644 POUNDS OF MEDICATION SINCE LAUNCHING “CRUSH THE CRISIS” IN 2017."}